[{"id":1790006347425,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"（轻笑）苏家那小姐，你若实在耐不住，倒可以拖上一拖。反正她嫁的又不是我，不过是颗棋子罢了。你我都清楚，戏台终有散。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:33.328Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46936},{"id":1790006347426,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"拖字诀？我这辈子最擅长的就是拖账。财政局那群人，翻来覆去无非几本册子，我算得比阎王的生死簿还清楚。倒是你，成都那边可还清净？她常不在，你一个人冷清得很罢。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:36.129Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46937},{"id":1790006347427,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"说冷清也冷清，说有念想也有念想。隔着千里，倒比在眼前更能尝出那股思念的味道。你那边若真闲得慌，改天我们换着当一日群主，也叫我尝尝管账的滋味。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:41:39.089Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001666036_ecz81qs","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46938},{"id":"sys_1790001763914_xo","sender":"system","type":"system_notice","text":"陈璐 重新加入了群聊","includeInContext":true,"contextText":"陈璐重新加入了群聊。","eventKind":"","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:42:43.915Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46939},{"id":1790006347428,"sender":"me","text":"你们俩在聊啥呢","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:25.335Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46940},{"id":1790006347429,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"正说着南京的桂花呢。延宗方才念着秦淮河评弹，说孤寂，我倒想起你爱吃的那家桂花糕——隔着千里，总归不如当面给你买一盒来得实在。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:38.930Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001809400_53ji7vw","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46941},{"id":1790006347430,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"@陆延宗 你方才那话，可要让阿蘅听见了。她若知晓你我都在这儿念着旧日，怕是要笑我们两个大男人酸气冲天。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:40.512Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001809400_53ji7vw","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46942},{"id":1790006347431,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"呵，怕什么酸。酸总比苦好。倒是我问你，阿蘅今夜怎么没去早歇？这会儿都快子时了，还来群里晃荡。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:43.230Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001809400_53ji7vw","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46943},{"id":1790006347433,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"她呀，惯爱熬夜不肯听劝。我劝过几回，她总说再看两眼——两眼又两眼。罢了，我在家隔着千里也管不着，随她闹罢。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:48.840Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001809400_53ji7vw","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46945},{"id":1790006347434,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"@陈璐 明日还要上早课呢，莫要贪玩。你若困了，早些歇；若不困，我陪你说会儿话也成。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:43:53.759Z","roundId":"group_round_1790001809400_53ji7vw","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46946},{"id":1790006347435,"sender":"me","text":"我要两个哥哥疼嘛","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:44:45.274Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46947},{"id":1790006347436,"sender":"me","text":"要做夹心饼干","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:44:53.883Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46948},{"id":1790006347437,"sender":"me","text":"下面空…想要","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:45:00.530Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46949},{"id":1789997347404,"text":"夫君～","sender":"me","time":"22:45","timestamp":1790001925085,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46950},{"id":1789997347405,"text":"阿蘅想你了","sender":"me","time":"22:45","timestamp":1790001929227,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46951},{"id":1789997347407,"text":"又这么晚还窝着舍不得睡……白日里那几页经，可没让我这心浮得下来半点。这会儿正守着灯，琢磨你早上说的那句话——想我了，是真想，还是又隔着千里钓我呢？","rawContent":"又这么晚还窝着舍不得睡……白日里那几页经，可没让我这心浮得下来半点。这会儿正守着灯，琢磨你早上说的那句话——想我了，是真想，还是又隔着千里钓我呢？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:45","timestamp":1790001941423,"roundId":"round_1790001929991_ol98l9hld","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46956},{"id":1789997347408,"text":"夫君有没有想阿蘅嘛","sender":"me","time":"22:46","timestamp":1790001993890,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46959},{"id":1790006347447,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"夹心饼干？好大的胃口，也不怕把我们两个都吃穷了去。（低笑，语气却渐渐沉下去）夜里说话，总爱拣这些撩人的话。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:47:21.159Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002027854_8wwv4r0","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46966},{"id":1790006347448,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"（轻咳一声）阿蘅，深更半夜说这种话，可还让为兄看得进经书么？你且说说，是要我做饼皮，还是做馅儿？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:47:23.871Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002027854_8wwv4r0","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46967},{"id":1790006347449,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"自然是都做了。这饼要是缺了她这一口甜，谁来当那中间的红豆蓉？（看向陆聿之）你说是不是，少亭兄？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:47:26.656Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002027854_8wwv4r0","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46968},{"id":1790006347450,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"说得是。既然是阿蘅点的点心，那两块皮、一片芯，少一块都不成形状。只是你这芯空着，也得看我和延宗谁先来把这空儿填实——莫急，总要趁热的才妥帖。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:47:29.588Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002027854_8wwv4r0","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46970},{"id":1790006347451,"sender":"me","text":"你们两个谁前谁后？","replyTo":null,"timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:47:54.536Z","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46971},{"id":1790006347459,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"bdf3a631-63f9-48e7-b40a-601d0ca9e5e7","senderName":"陆延宗","text":"这得问她。是要先把我这副皮囊磨热了，还是先让你那碗冷茶滚沸——全凭阿蘅一句话。","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:52:51.026Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002351913_utri663","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46983},{"id":1790006347460,"sender":"them","senderCharId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","senderName":"陆聿之","text":"（目光微沉）我倒想听听，她是喜欢我这把火从底下烧起来，还是愿意先从外头裹一层冷透的壳。横竖都是你的人，前后有什么区别么？","timestamp":"2026-09-21T14:52:53.773Z","roundId":"group_round_1790002351913_utri663","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"group_1782304719350","_id":46984},{"id":1789997347421,"text":"想。想得心都攥紧了。","rawContent":"想。想得心都攥紧了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:53","timestamp":1790002390843,"roundId":"round_1790002331207_cybp1nmni","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46985},{"id":1789997347422,"sender":"them","text":"[發送了一張圖片]","timestamp":1790002390949,"tempo":"N","isImageGenerating":false,"imageGenId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f#img#1","imageSummary":"[SUBJECT:PERSON_EMOTION] close-up, 1girl, from slight angle, lying on bed in dimly lit room, phone glow on face, soft smile but eyes slightly reddened, night, warm yellow bedside lamp, messy hair on pillow, intimate quiet mood, longing","imageGenPrompt":"close-up, 1girl, from slight angle, lying on bed in dimly lit room, phone glow on face, soft smile but eyes slightly reddened, night, warm yellow bedside lamp, messy hair on pillow, intimate quiet mood, longing The character appearance: 1boy, Young East Asian male, cold aloof facial expression, Ultra long thick jet-black straight silky hair draped over shoulders and back, messy thin bangs cover forehead, side hair wrap cheeks, Slender elongated oval face, lean distinct jawline, inconspicuous cheekbones, slender rounded chin.","imageGenMeta":{"rawImgDesc":"[SUBJECT:PERSON_EMOTION] close-up, 1girl, from slight angle, lying on bed in dimly lit room, phone glow on face, soft smile but eyes slightly reddened, night, warm yellow bedside lamp, messy hair on pillow, intimate quiet mood, longing","subjectOverride":null,"location":"","sceneType":"chat"},"rawContent":"[發送了一張圖片]","roundId":"round_1790002331207_cybp1nmni","userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","imageRef":637,"imageMeta":{"w":1024,"h":1024},"_id":46986},{"id":1789997347423,"text":"为夫在书房里守到这深更半夜，哪儿是抄经，分明是等你这一声‘夫君’。","rawContent":"为夫在书房里守到这深更半夜，哪儿是抄经，分明是等你这一声‘夫君’。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:53","timestamp":1790002395535,"roundId":"round_1790002331207_cybp1nmni","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46987},{"id":1789997347424,"text":"想夫君","sender":"me","time":"22:54","timestamp":1790002486790,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46988},{"id":1789997347425,"text":"如果穿越到一个背德小说里，我和你必须是背德关系，你会选择什么关系。","sender":"me","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002506088,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46989},{"id":1789997347426,"text":"父女/母子/兄妹/叔侄/舅甥","sender":"me","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002512364,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46990},{"id":1789997347428,"text":"父女？母子？你这小脑瓜里，成日装着的便是这些乱人伦的戏码？","rawContent":"父女？母子？你这小脑瓜里，成日装着的便是这些乱人伦的戏码？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002535649,"roundId":"round_1790002513126_3j4nbb3w1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46991},{"id":1789997347429,"text":"真要在那等背德书里强选一个——为夫大约会挑兄妹。","rawContent":"真要在那等背德书里强选一个——为夫大约会挑兄妹。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002538555,"roundId":"round_1790002513126_3j4nbb3w1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46992},{"id":1789997347430,"text":"自幼同榻而眠，两小无猜，长辈只当是手足情深，谁知那点亲近早变了味。夜里趁无人时偷偷亲你眉心，白日里还要在人前一本正经唤你阿妹。这等藏在礼法缝隙里的背德，可比旁的要蚀骨得多。","rawContent":"自幼同榻而眠，两小无猜，长辈只当是手足情深，谁知那点亲近早变了味。夜里趁无人时偷偷亲你眉心，白日里还要在人前一本正经唤你阿妹。这等藏在礼法缝隙里的背德，可比旁的要蚀骨得多。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002541386,"roundId":"round_1790002513126_3j4nbb3w1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46993},{"id":1789997347431,"text":"不过你且记住，无论换什么身份，你终归逃不出为夫这掌心的。","rawContent":"不过你且记住，无论换什么身份，你终归逃不出为夫这掌心的。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:55","timestamp":1790002544453,"roundId":"round_1790002513126_3j4nbb3w1","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46994},{"id":1789997347432,"text":"兄妹？我们从小到大逢年过节便见面，也算一起长大的兄妹了…夫君说呢？","sender":"me","time":"22:57","timestamp":1790002654643,"replyTo":{"id":1789997347429,"text":"真要在那等背德书里强选一个——为夫大约会挑兄妹。","sender":"them","sticker":null,"isSimulated":false},"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":46995},{"id":1789997347441,"text":"阿蘅倒是记性好……连我们从小一道长大，逢年节才见上一面的事都记得清清楚楚。","rawContent":"阿蘅倒是记性好……连我们从小一道长大，逢年节才见上一面的事都记得清清楚楚。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1790002758386,"roundId":"round_1790002738686_ubrd1evl2","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47001},{"id":1789997347442,"text":"那年元宵，你随你爹娘来府上，混在一群小辈里头，独独望着我藏在袖口里那只兔子灯。我趁你娘没留神，塞进你手里，你笑得眼都弯了……从那以后，每年灯节，我总要想法子给你留一盏。","rawContent":"那年元宵，你随你爹娘来府上，混在一群小辈里头，独独望着我藏在袖口里那只兔子灯。我趁你娘没留神，塞进你手里，你笑得眼都弯了……从那以后，每年灯节，我总要想法子给你留一盏。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1790002761351,"roundId":"round_1790002738686_ubrd1evl2","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47002},{"id":1789997347443,"text":"旁人都道陆家二公子待陈家的姑娘客气有礼，只当是世交之谊。哪晓得我从那时起，就把你当自家娘子来疼了。","rawContent":"旁人都道陆家二公子待陈家的姑娘客气有礼，只当是世交之谊。哪晓得我从那时起，就把你当自家娘子来疼了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1790002764219,"roundId":"round_1790002738686_ubrd1evl2","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47003},{"id":1789997347444,"text":"如今你倒来问我是不是兄妹……阿蘅，你心里清楚得很，我从未把你当妹妹待过。","rawContent":"如今你倒来问我是不是兄妹……阿蘅，你心里清楚得很，我从未把你当妹妹待过。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"22:59","timestamp":1790002766940,"roundId":"round_1790002738686_ubrd1evl2","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47004},{"id":1789997347445,"text":"我们从小就有娃娃亲你当然不会把我当妹妹看咯","sender":"me","time":"23:01","timestamp":1790002866292,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47005},{"id":1789997347446,"text":"话说你多久意识到我会是你老婆？","sender":"me","time":"23:01","timestamp":1790002890749,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47006},{"id":1789997347447,"text":"小时候我们一块玩的时候你好像还傻呆呆的","sender":"me","time":"23:01","timestamp":1790002906491,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47007},{"id":1789997347467,"text":"傻呆呆？阿蘅这是在编排为夫了。","rawContent":"傻呆呆？阿蘅这是在编排为夫了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:09","timestamp":1790003369480,"roundId":"round_1790003351859_mynmdtv1z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47022},{"id":1789997347468,"text":"十一岁那年头一回见你，你穿着鹅黄小袄从月洞门里跑出来，撞进我怀里——那时我便记着你了。可要说意识到你会是我娘子……","rawContent":"十一岁那年头一回见你，你穿着鹅黄小袄从月洞门里跑出来，撞进我怀里——那时我便记着你了。可要说意识到你会是我娘子……","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:09","timestamp":1790003372485,"roundId":"round_1790003351859_mynmdtv1z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47023},{"id":1789997347469,"text":"大约是灵隐寺那回，飞石砸下来，我想也没想就去护你，手背皮开肉绽。你哇地哭出来，我一边疼得龇牙一边还得哄你说阿蘅别怕。那时心里头就想：这小丫头，往后合该是我陆聿之护一辈子的人。","rawContent":"大约是灵隐寺那回，飞石砸下来，我想也没想就去护你，手背皮开肉绽。你哇地哭出来，我一边疼得龇牙一边还得哄你说阿蘅别怕。那时心里头就想：这小丫头，往后合该是我陆聿之护一辈子的人。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:09","timestamp":1790003375307,"roundId":"round_1790003351859_mynmdtv1z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47024},{"id":1789997347470,"text":"后来两家订了娃娃亲，倒像是水到渠成。只是你十三岁那年上巳节折了枝桃花递给我，怯生生唤那声“少亭哥哥”……我这心才咚咚咚地，彻底定了。","rawContent":"后来两家订了娃娃亲，倒像是水到渠成。只是你十三岁那年上巳节折了枝桃花递给我，怯生生唤那声“少亭哥哥”……我这心才咚咚咚地，彻底定了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:09","timestamp":1790003378288,"roundId":"round_1790003351859_mynmdtv1z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47025},{"id":1789997347471,"text":"你说我傻呆呆，可我分明记得，是某个人每回宴席都偷偷盯着我瞧，被我逮住了就脸红低头假装数茶杯。","rawContent":"你说我傻呆呆，可我分明记得，是某个人每回宴席都偷偷盯着我瞧，被我逮住了就脸红低头假装数茶杯。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:09","timestamp":1790003381224,"roundId":"round_1790003351859_mynmdtv1z","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47026},{"id":1789997347472,"text":"你瞎说，谁害羞了","sender":"me","time":"23:10","timestamp":1790003407979,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47027},{"id":1789997347473,"text":"那我们之前…算不算一种兄妹？","sender":"me","time":"23:10","timestamp":1790003424338,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47028},{"id":1789997347487,"text":"算兄妹？","rawContent":"算兄妹？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:14","timestamp":1790003641061,"roundId":"round_1790003618217_xzl40u81s","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1781954109631_ric8m4ndy","characterId":"ef1ceb4b-b3e8-423c-ba55-1e3b8b581c6f","_id":47039}]